WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.308 --> 00:00:17.228
you sure your sock is gone?"

2
00:00:17.548 --> 00:00:18.329
Henry asked.

3
00:00:18.349 --> 00:00:21.550
"Maybe it fell into the bottom of your bag."

4
00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:24.470
Maggie dumped her bag out on the bench.

5
00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:26.651
"No, it's not here.

6
00:00:26.751 --> 00:00:27.931
Someone stole it!

7
00:00:28.812 --> 00:00:31.768
Just like all my other stuff!"

8
00:00:31.788 --> 00:00:34.289
"Why would someone steal one sock?"

9
00:00:34.649 --> 00:00:35.310
Cole wondered.

10
00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:37.891
Maggie didn't answer.

11
00:00:38.991 --> 00:00:41.512
She was already stomping down the aisle of the barn.

12
00:00:41.532 --> 00:00:44.233
"Uh-oh," Henry said.

13
00:00:44.253 --> 00:00:46.634
"We'd better follow her."

14
00:00:47.655 --> 00:00:49.896
He knew that his cousin had a quick temper.

15
00:00:50.916 --> 00:00:56.418
If she started yelling about her sock, she might accidentally warn the thief that the boys were investigating.

16
00:00:57.859 --> 00:00:59.700
Maggie stopped in front of a horse stall.

17
00:01:00.704 --> 00:01:03.126
Daisy was standing in the doorway holding a saddle.

18
00:01:03.146 --> 00:01:05.688
"My sock is missing!"

19
00:01:06.069 --> 00:01:06.669
Maggie said.

20
00:01:06.689 --> 00:01:08.671
"Did you take it?"

21
00:01:09.712 --> 00:01:11.393
Daisy gave her a surprised look.

22
00:01:11.413 --> 00:01:13.955
"Why would I take your sock?

23
00:01:14.996 --> 00:01:15.897
I have my own."

24
00:01:16.998 --> 00:01:18.079
She pointed to her feet.

25
00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:21.422
Two pink socks were sticking out above her boots.

26
00:01:22.983 --> 00:01:26.446
Henry grabbed Maggie's arm as Daisy went into her horse's stall.

27
00:01:26.466 --> 00:01:28.788
"Wait," he said.

28
00:01:29.912 --> 00:01:32.374
"Yelling at people won't get your sock back."

29
00:01:33.455 --> 00:01:35.756
"Or any of the other stuff," added Cole.

30
00:01:36.777 --> 00:01:37.838
"Let us investigate."

31
00:01:38.959 --> 00:01:41.520
For a second Henry didn't think Maggie would agree.

32
00:01:42.501 --> 00:01:43.762
But finally she nodded.

33
00:01:43.782 --> 00:01:46.884
"Okay," she said.

34
00:01:46.904 --> 00:01:50.507
"But how am I supposed to ride with only one sock?"

35
00:01:51.608 --> 00:01:53.029
Cole kicked off his sneakers.

36
00:01:53.049 --> 00:01:56.091
"You can borrow one of mine," he said.

37
00:01:56.111 --> 00:01:59.977
"Yuck. Boys' socks stink."

38
00:02:01.077 --> 00:02:02.018
Maggie made a face.

39
00:02:03.039 --> 00:02:04.639
But she took the sock Cole handed her.

40
00:02:04.659 --> 00:02:08.502
"I guess I'll have to suffer if I want to ride."

41
00:02:09.982 --> 00:02:12.484
Then she stomped back toward Big Spot's stall.

42
00:02:13.584 --> 00:02:16.426
Cole took off his other sock and stuck it in his pocket.

43
00:02:17.466 --> 00:02:18.807
Then he put his shoes back on.

44
00:02:18.827 --> 00:02:22.729
"Are we really going to investigate a missing sock?"

45
00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:23.850
he asked Henry.

46
00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:27.352
"She probably just left it in the car or something."

47
00:02:28.288 --> 00:02:30.390
"You could be right," Henry admitted.

48
00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:34.913
"Did you notice if she had both socks in her bag when we came in?"

49
00:02:36.394 --> 00:02:37.214
Cole laughed.

50
00:02:37.314 --> 00:02:45.000
"No. I don't usually go around counting people's socks, especially when they're not even on their feet."

51
00:02:46.121 --> 00:02:47.341
That gave Henry an idea.

52
00:02:47.362 --> 00:02:50.604
"I know what we can do," he said.

53
00:02:50.624 --> 00:02:54.507
"Let's go see what socks everybody else is wearing.

54
00:02:55.587 --> 00:02:59.542
For example, we know Daisy isn't wearing Maggie's missing sock.

55
00:03:00.523 --> 00:03:02.844
Her socks are pink, and Maggie's are white."

56
00:03:04.245 --> 00:03:06.667
"Do you really think someone took that sock?"

57
00:03:07.728 --> 00:03:08.428
"Who knows?"

58
00:03:08.828 --> 00:03:09.649
Henry shrugged.

59
00:03:09.669 --> 00:03:15.713
"Maybe someone forgot a sock and decided to borrow Maggie's since she wasn't watching it."

60
00:03:16.814 --> 00:03:22.438
"Even if someone did borrow a sock, that doesn't mean that person is the barn thief," Cole said.

61
00:03:22.458 --> 00:03:25.760
"True," Henry agreed.

62
00:03:26.908 --> 00:03:31.250
"But we can watch for other suspicious behavior while we check everyone's socks."

63
00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:33.651
They walked back to Zach.

64
00:03:34.651 --> 00:03:36.732
By now he was putting a saddle on his pony.

65
00:03:38.313 --> 00:03:39.373
"What do you want?"

66
00:03:39.793 --> 00:03:41.594
he asked when he saw Henry and Cole.

67
00:03:42.595 --> 00:03:43.975
He sounded kind of grumpy.

68
00:03:43.995 --> 00:03:48.377
"Nothing." Henry looked at Zach's feet.

69
00:03:49.357 --> 00:03:51.898
He was wearing athletic socks with stripes on them.

70
00:03:52.899 --> 00:03:54.259
"Do you know where Eleanor is?"

71
00:03:54.279 --> 00:03:58.397
"Nope." Zach adjusted the pony's saddle.

72
00:03:59.438 --> 00:04:00.859
Henry and Cole walked away.

73
00:04:00.879 --> 00:04:03.902
"Wrong socks," Cole whispered.

74
00:04:04.943 --> 00:04:05.643
Henry nodded.

75
00:04:05.663 --> 00:04:08.706
"Two suspects down, one to go."

76
00:04:08.726 --> 00:04:10.307
"Only one?"

77
00:04:10.647 --> 00:04:11.248
Cole said.

78
00:04:11.268 --> 00:04:13.550
"What about Jill and Ms.

79
00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:16.472
Wood?" Henry thought about that.

80
00:04:16.492 --> 00:04:18.774
"I don't think Ms.

81
00:04:18.814 --> 00:04:20.996
Wood is a good suspect," he said.

82
00:04:21.016 --> 00:04:24.439
"Why would an adult steal a kid's stuff?

83
00:04:26.092 --> 00:04:28.933
Plus she was going to get the check from Maggie anyway.

84
00:04:29.954 --> 00:04:32.194
But we probably should investigate Jill."

85
00:04:33.195 --> 00:04:35.376
They wandered around until they found Eleanor.

86
00:04:40.598 --> 00:04:42.619
She was leading a pony out of its stall.

87
00:04:44.099 --> 00:04:45.200
Henry looked at her feet.

88
00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:48.661
She was wearing short boots, just like the others.

89
00:04:49.761 --> 00:04:51.862
But her pants completely covered her socks.

90
00:04:53.063 --> 00:04:53.583
Now what?

91
00:04:54.763 --> 00:04:55.724
Cole had an idea.

92
00:04:56.844 --> 00:04:58.345
"Hey, Eleanor," he said.

93
00:04:58.365 --> 00:05:01.687
"Is that a bug crawling up your pant leg?"

94
00:05:01.707 --> 00:05:04.969
"What? Which leg?"

95
00:05:06.089 --> 00:05:06.990
Eleanor shrieked.

96
00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:10.972
She dropped the pony's reins and yanked up both pant legs.

97
00:05:12.213 --> 00:05:13.313
Her socks were brown.

98
00:05:13.333 --> 00:05:17.696
"Sorry, I guess I was wrong," Cole said.

99
00:05:18.857 --> 00:05:20.518
Eleanor gave him an angry look.

100
00:05:21.578 --> 00:05:23.839
Then she grabbed her pony's reins and hurried off.

101
00:05:27.224 --> 00:05:29.305
"Good trick," Henry said with a grin.

102
00:05:29.325 --> 00:05:33.468
"I guess it proved that nobody is wearing that sock.

103
00:05:34.649 --> 00:05:36.490
Maybe Maggie did leave it in the car."

104
00:05:36.510 --> 00:05:41.474
"Or maybe Big Spot grabbed it," Cole suggested.

105
00:05:41.494 --> 00:05:44.856
"Maggie left her bag sitting right by his stall."

106
00:05:45.836 --> 00:05:48.078
"Yeah. Let's go check."

107
00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:52.941
They hurried back to Big Spot's stall.

108
00:05:53.982 --> 00:05:55.023
The pony was gone.

109
00:05:56.143 --> 00:05:56.864
So was Maggie.

110
00:05:58.068 --> 00:06:00.830
"I guess the riding lesson started," Henry said.

111
00:06:02.311 --> 00:06:03.953
Cole looked into the pony's stall.

112
00:06:03.973 --> 00:06:06.395
"I don't see the sock in here.

113
00:06:07.375 --> 00:06:08.376
Maybe Spot ate it.

114
00:06:09.377 --> 00:06:11.318
He wanted to eat Maggie's hair, remember?"

115
00:06:12.419 --> 00:06:13.300
Henry shrugged.

116
00:06:13.320 --> 00:06:21.326
"Maybe. But he definitely didn't eat that brush that disappeared or Maggie's charm bracelet.

117
00:06:22.307 --> 00:06:23.868
We have to find that thief!"
